          "description": "Little Symphony’s music is designed for little listeners to connect with nature around the world. Experience North America’s natural wonder of Niagara Falls through immersive ambient music that promotes peaceful sleep. This card blends calming instrumental sounds with soothing field recordings of the falls. Listen to the powerful yet tranquil sound of rhythmic cascading water, creating a comforting space and a perfect white-noise sleepy soundtrack to help babies and kids wind down for bedtime. The serenity of Niagara's waterfalls can also bring a state of stillness and focus to play or even enhance story time with an authentic natural atmosphere.",
